---
description: Search gutt organizational memory before starting tasks
---

Before starting any non-trivial task, search organizational memory using gutt-mcp-remote
MCP tools (search_memory_facts, search_memory_nodes, fetch_lessons_learned) to find:

- Previous decisions and their rationale
- Lessons learned from similar work
- Known issues and workarounds
- Established patterns and conventions

After completing significant work, capture lessons and decisions using add_memory so
future sessions can build on what was learned.
